* trace2_otft.lib - parameter corners for trace2_otft.sub (see MODEL_NOTES.md)

* lab: anchored to published flexible DNTT TFTs with thin AlOx/SAM dielectric
.lib lab
.param MU=1.0 CI=0.70e-6 SS=0.080 RCW=400 JOFF=1e-14 VTH0=1.25 LOV=2
.endl lab

* printed: pessimistic low-cost corner. ASSUMED values, not from a specific paper
.lib printed
.param MU=0.30 CI=0.30e-6 SS=0.200 RCW=5000 JOFF=1e-12 VTH0=1.25 LOV=5
.endl printed
